    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active Product2 records with no blng__TaxRule__c assigned.
Why it matters: Tax can&apos;t be computed on quote lines or invoices for these products. You either under-bill (no tax collected, exposure on audit) or block invoicing — and the customer experiences a tax-line surprise on the first invoice.
Suppress a finding: for genuinely tax-exempt SKUs where blng__TaxableYesNo__c is set to No.
Disable the detector: only if your business model is 100% tax-exempt. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
